{
  title: "sum_array"
}
---
### NAME

    sum_array() - Calculates the sum of all integers in an array.

### SYNOPSIS

    int sum_array( int *nums );

### DESCRIPTION

    Calculates the sum of all integers in an array.

### PARAMETERS

    nums  (int*)
          Array of integers to sum

### RETURN VALUES

    (int) The sum of all elements
